  "daily_overview": "今日全球呈现技术、财经与时政的三重震荡。技术领域，苹果宣布集成阿里大模型，AI 代理（Agent）技术在解释性与安全性上取得重大突破，同时 AI 基建公司如 Modal 市值飙升至 160 亿美元，但市场对 AI 的过度估值开始产生担忧。财经方面，中东局势再度紧张推高油价至 110 美元/桶，引发全球能源与通胀担忧，华尔街科技股遭遇重大周跌幅。时政层面，中东冲突外溢至海运与基建，俄乌冲突中星链策略引发争议，全球社会动荡因素持续累积。整体看，资本正在从高风险的 AI 概念股撤出，转向更具确定性的避险资产，全球供应链与能源安全已成核心博弈点。\n\nToday's global landscape is defined by the convergence of tech, finance, and geopolitical shocks. In tech, Apple integrated Alibaba's LLM, and AI Agent interpretability improved, yet investors are growing wary of AI valuations despite infrastructure players like Modal reaching a $16B valuation. Financially, Middle East tensions pushed oil to $110, fueling inflation fears and a tech sell-off on Wall Street. Politically, conflict continues to disrupt maritime and energy sectors, while the role of Starlink in the Ukraine conflict remains contentious. Capital is pivoting from high-risk AI bets toward safe-haven assets, highlighting the critical fragility of global energy and supply chains.",
